{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26038","headline":"岐路 · 鲍溶","name":"岐路","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北风送微寒，徒侣勤远征。\n忧人席不煖，残月马上明。\n飘飘岐路间，长见日初生。\n重嶂晓色浅，疎猨寒啼清。\n人间多岐路，常恐终身行。\n回见四方人，车轮无留声。\n空谷亦堪隐，下田非嬾耕。\n古人有遗训，饱食非亲荣。\n我生礼义乡，少小见太平。\n圣贤犹羁旅，况复非其名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}